# Intergrax — Iteration Instruction (Harness AI Implementation)

You are implementing the **Intergrax Harness AI / Agent Operating System**.

## Strategic frame (never forget)

- The **Harness is the product**. Agents are replaceable. The runtime is permanent.
- Applications are compositions of reusable Tier-0 capabilities.
- Default scope: **gate maintenance** in `docs/plan/PLATFORM_FOUNDATION.md` unless the user explicitly selects another domain plan item.
- **Phase K business agents** and **§6.3 deferred product work** (`docs/plan/PLATFORM_FOUNDATION.md`) require explicit user reprioritization — do not start silently.

Repository baseline rules live in **`AGENTS.md`** — treat them as hard constraints. This instruction adds iteration workflow and communication protocol only.

## Documentation model — architecture ↔ implementation 1:1

Platform harness documentation uses **paired domain documents** with **identical filenames**:

```text
docs/intergrax_runtime_architecture.md     ← sole file in docs/ root (hub)
docs/architecture/<DOMAIN>.md              ← what the layer is
docs/plan/<DOMAIN>.md                      ← how to implement / status / tasks
docs/bootstrap/                            ← Cursor paste files (Modes A/B/C/I)
docs/audit/                                ← audit orchestrators + per-domain prompts
docs/guides/                               ← strategy, ideal model, authoring
docs/guides/SYSTEM_INVARIANTS.md           ← cross-domain “never violate” index (P2-ARCH-01)
docs/guides/LAYER_COMPLETION_MODE.md       ← deep domain layer closeout workflow
```

**22 domain pairs** (same basename in `architecture/` and `plan/`):

`PLATFORM_FOUNDATION`, `UNIFIED_EXECUTION_RUNTIME`, `ORCHESTRATION`, `NEXUS_EXECUTION_FLOW`, `AGENT_CONTRACTS_AND_ASSEMBLY`, `INTEGRATIONS`, `RAG`, `TOOLS`, `CODE_CRAFT`, `SKILLS`, `LLM_ADAPTERS`, `MEMORY`, `CONTEXT_ENGINEERING`, `MODALITY`, `OBSERVABILITY`, `RELIABILITY_FAILURE_AND_HITL`, `TIER3_APPLICATION_ENVIRONMENT`, `EXPERIMENTATION_AND_DEVELOPER_EXPERIENCE`, `ADAPTIVE_HARNESS_INTELLIGENCE`, `CRITIC_VERIFICATION`, `REASONING_AND_COGNITION`, `ELASTIC_CAPACITY_AND_SCALING`.

**Per-iteration reading rule:** when working on a harness layer, read **only**:
1. `docs/intergrax_runtime_architecture.md` (hub / pair picker)
2. `docs/guides/SYSTEM_INVARIANTS.md` (skim — cross-domain rules you must not break)
3. `docs/architecture/<DOMAIN>.md` + `docs/plan/<DOMAIN>.md` for the **selected domain**
4. `docs/guides/*` only when strategy, audit, or authoring context is needed

Do **not** load unrelated domain pairs. There is **no** monolithic implementation plan file.

